<title>USA: Paradyne names company president.</title>
<headline>Paradyne names company president.</headline>
<dateline>LARGO, Fla. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paradyne said on Wednesday that its board of directors named Andrew May president and chief operating officer, a newly created position.</p>
<p>Paradyne, a developer of network access products that was formerly a unit of Lucent Technologies Inc, said May was previously a vice president and general manager for 3Com Corp.</p>
<p>Lucent sold Paradyne on August 1, 1996, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
